# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch work and local development tests
#
# Everything that is not part of the shipped extension lives here: temp/ holds
# diagnostic scripts, captured canvases and test transcripts, test/ holds the
# Node test suites and their fixture. Neither folder belongs in the repository.
# dist/ is the release output of scripts/build.js, rebuilt by the Release
# workflow (.github/workflows/release.yml).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
temp/
.temp/
tmp/
.tmp/
test/
.test/
doc/
docs/
dist/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.log
*.out
*~

# Test transcripts and captured boards the diagnostics write next to the code.
canvas-*.txt
canvas-*.log
fiber-*.txt
out-*.txt
err-*.txt
drift.txt
t[0-9].txt
ta.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and IDEs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.code-workspace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Coding agents
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
.agent/
.agentsrc
.agentrc
.codewhale/
.codex/
.copilot/
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
*.agent.md
AGENTS.local.md

